---
source: mdcore/src/markdown.rs
expression: "render(\"Some *em*, **strong**, ***both***, ~~gone~~ and `code` or ``a ` b``.\\n\")"
---
Emphasis "*em*" ["*", "*"]
Strong "**strong**" ["**", "**"]
Emphasis "***both***" ["*", "*"]
Strong "**both**" ["**", "**"]
Strikethrough "~~gone~~" ["~~", "~~"]
Code "`code`" ["`", "`"]
Code "``a ` b``" ["``", "``"]
